Output docs/demos/gifs/shell-check-console.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set TypingSpeed 15ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.8

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "poetry run gitlab-compliance shell-check -p docs/demos/fixtures/shell-check/bad.gitlab-ci.yml"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "echo exit:$?"
Enter
Sleep 1s
